c4171e17-eb37-4dc6-a27e-153d9ff1a3a6	\N	51b09576-8b30-43b3-934b-6513c76538ba	functional_spec.md	specification	# Functional Specification\n\n**Run ID:** `51b09576-8b30-43b3-934b-6513c76538ba`\n**Project ID:** `b7c7ab14-9d35-4fec-a9be-b876e38d16b9`\n**Generated:** 2026-05-15T04:49:19.637510+00:00\n**Version:** 1.0\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis specification contains **14 requirements** (8 functional, 6 non-functional).\n\n| Priority | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Must | 9 |\n| Should | 5 |\n| Could | 0 |\n| Won't | 0 |\n\n---\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n### REQ-AUTH-001: User Authentication\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall provide secure user authentication with email/password and support for OAuth2 providers.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-001-1: Users can register with email and password\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-001-2: Users can log in with valid credentials\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-001-3: Users can authenticate via OAuth2 (Google, GitHub)\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-001-4: Failed login attempts are rate-limited\n\n---\n\n### REQ-AUTH-002: Authorization & Access Control\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall enforce role-based access control (RBAC) for all protected resources.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-002-1: Roles can be assigned to users\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-002-2: API endpoints enforce role permissions\n- [ ] AC-AUTH-002-3: Unauthorized access returns 403\n\n---\n\n### REQ-API-001: REST API\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall expose a RESTful API with JSON request/response format.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-API-001-1: All endpoints return JSON\n- [ ] AC-API-001-2: API follows REST conventions\n- [ ] AC-API-001-3: API versioning is supported via URL path\n\n---\n\n### REQ-DATA-001: Data Persistence\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall persist all application data in a relational database with migration support.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-DATA-001-1: Database schema is versioned\n- [ ] AC-DATA-001-2: Migrations are reversible\n- [ ] AC-DATA-001-3: Data integrity constraints are enforced\n\n---\n\n### REQ-DATA-002: Data Validation\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall validate all input data before processing or storage.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-DATA-002-1: Invalid input returns 400 with error details\n- [ ] AC-DATA-002-2: SQL injection is prevented\n- [ ] AC-DATA-002-3: XSS is prevented in all user inputs\n\n---\n\n### REQ-ERR-001: Error Handling\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall provide consistent error responses with appropriate HTTP status codes.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-ERR-001-1: All errors return structured JSON\n- [ ] AC-ERR-001-2: 500 errors do not leak stack traces\n- [ ] AC-ERR-001-3: Error codes are documented\n\n---\n\n### REQ-API-002: API Documentation\n\n**Priority:** should | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall provide OpenAPI/Swagger documentation for all API endpoints.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-API-002-1: OpenAPI spec is auto-generated\n- [ ] AC-API-002-2: All endpoints have descriptions\n- [ ] AC-API-002-3: Request/response schemas are documented\n\n---\n\n### REQ-LOG-001: Application Logging\n\n**Priority:** should | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall log all significant events with appropriate severity levels.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-LOG-001-1: Logs include timestamp, severity, and context\n- [ ] AC-LOG-001-2: Logs are structured (JSON format)\n- [ ] AC-LOG-001-3: Sensitive data is redacted in logs\n\n---\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n### REQ-PERF-001: Response Time\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nAPI endpoints shall respond within 200ms for 95th percentile under normal load.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-PERF-001-1: P95 latency < 200ms at 100 RPS\n- [ ] AC-PERF-001-2: P99 latency < 500ms at 100 RPS\n\n---\n\n### REQ-PERF-002: Throughput\n\n**Priority:** should | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall handle at least 1000 concurrent users.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-PERF-002-1: System supports 1000 concurrent connections\n- [ ] AC-PERF-002-2: No degradation under sustained load\n\n---\n\n### REQ-SEC-001: Data Encryption\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nAll sensitive data shall be encrypted at rest and in transit.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-SEC-001-1: TLS 1.3 for all connections\n- [ ] AC-SEC-001-2: AES-256 for data at rest\n- [ ] AC-SEC-001-3: Passwords hashed with bcrypt/argon2\n\n---\n\n### REQ-SEC-002: Security Headers\n\n**Priority:** must | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall implement standard security headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options).\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-SEC-002-1: CSP header is present\n- [ ] AC-SEC-002-2: HSTS header is present\n- [ ] AC-SEC-002-3: X-Frame-Options is DENY\n\n---\n\n### REQ-REL-001: Availability\n\n**Priority:** should | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe system shall target 99.9% uptime.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-REL-001-1: Health check endpoint exists\n- [ ] AC-REL-001-2: Graceful shutdown is supported\n- [ ] AC-REL-001-3: No single point of failure\n\n---\n\n### REQ-USA-001: Usability\n\n**Priority:** should | **Source:** `default`\n\nThe API shall provide clear, consistent error messages and documentation.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] AC-USA-001-1: Error messages are human-readable\n- [ ] AC-USA-001-2: API docs are accessible\n- [ ] AC-USA-001-3: Examples are provided for all endpoints\n\n---\n\n## Validation Results\n\n**8 issues found:**\n\n| Code | Severity | Message | Requirement |\n|------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement PERF-001: unresolved dependency 'performance' | PERF-001 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement PERF-002: unresolved dependency 'performance' | PERF-002 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement PERF-002: unresolved dependency 'scalability' | PERF-002 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement SEC-001: unresolved dependency 'security' | SEC-001 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement SEC-002: unresolved dependency 'security' | SEC-002 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement REL-001: unresolved dependency 'reliability' | REL-001 |\n| UNRESOLVED_DEP | error | Requirement USA-001: unresolved dependency 'usability' | USA-001 |\n| MISSING_NFR_CATEGORY | warning | Missing NFR categories: reliability, security, usability, performance, scalability | N/A |\n	\N	1	f	f	{"version": 1, "spec_version_id": "c9d4b630-ecd8-4002-9248-a395395cb009"}	2026-05-15 04:49:19.615229+00	specification	\N	\N
