atic reconnection for live event streaming.\n\n**Consequences:**\n- Low-latency updates\n- Bidirectional communication\n- Connection management complexity\n\n---\n\n	/tmp/cortex-artifacts/51b09576-8b30-43b3-934b-6513c76538ba/ADRs.md	1	f	f	{"subdir": "", "phase_name": "architecture", "size_bytes": 1986, "content_hash": "170183ec11b4a1d347951f424ecea345d2fe4e578c21f308d26721f86d8585d5", "source_engine": "architecture-engine", "parent_artifact_id": null}	2026-05-15 04:49:19.834699+00	architecture	\N	\N
